 PROCEDURE CODE
1148
Whenever a serious interest so requires, the affixing of seals to objects belonging to the joint estate of spouses, to a succession or to an undivided interest may be requested :   
1¡ by those who claim a right to them and by their personal creditors; 
2¡ by all creditors of the succession, of the joint estate or of the undivided interest; 
3¡ by the persons who lived with the deceased or who were in his domestic service, if the spouse, the heirs or one of them is not present; 
4¡ by the executor of the will.
